  "repeats": 5,
  "split": "seed=2026111300+100*family_index+repeat; family_index1..16 from list, repeat1..5. numpy.default_rng permutation: test first, train next, unused remainder. train=min(384,(7*N)//10), test=min(512,N-train). Exact rational floor corrects prior Music floating-point 251 to252.",
  "masks": "3 random order banks, each nested cost20/40/60/80; Full once. Integer costs1..10 seed202611130000+family_index. bank permutation seed=split+100000+bank, bank0..2. Longest cumulative prefix <= floor(percent*total_cost/100). All slots retained even if masks duplicate; duplicates do not become independent samples.",
  "geometry": "Balanced training-Full calibration; fixed zeta=.5; beta=1, source-directed query retrieval, max training symmetrization; k=5. U versus local label-KL L. All scales and weights fit on training only. Existing E0.2 implementation is included and hashed.",
  "representation": "Same accepted anchored partition: raw L; covered-only mean; ball-residual; same-covered random accepted groups5seeds; global-mean shrink secondary. For all smoothing targets primary alpha=.5. Additional residual endpointalpha=1 reported separately, never selected by test loss.",
  "granulation": "Frozen anchored oracle, smin2,kappa.1,alpha(radius)1,pair_budget256. Radius alpha is distinct from smoothing alpha. No per-family threshold tuning.",
  "random": "Shuffle only covered IDs, preserve exact coverage membership, each accepted size, residual IDs and prototype slots. 5 seeds split+300000+1000*mask_slot+seed_index. Report mean of per-seed losses, not a prediction ensemble; no best seed selection.",
  "primary_contrasts": {
    "geometry": "Brier(L,raw)-Brier(U,raw)",
    "grouping": "Brier(L,ball alpha.5)-Brier(L,covered_mean alpha.5)"
  },
  "secondary_contrasts": [
    "L ball minus L same-covered random atalpha.5",
    "L ball minus L global-mean atalpha.5",
    "L ball minus L raw",
    "geometry-by-ball interaction",
    "Full endpoint results and alpha1 residual"
  ],
  "primary_aggregation": "Within each family, mean signed differences equally over5 repeats,3banks,4 reduced budget fractions. Then equal-family mean over16. Full reported separately. Provide each family/budget result, signs and spread. No treating repeated splits, masks, null seeds or Yeast labeling tasks as independent datasets.",
  "statistics": "Descriptive effect sizes and family-level summaries primary; no confirmatory significance claims. Known/related datasets and object splits limit inference. All negative results and failed cases retained.",
  "scoring": "Brier is row-summed squared error averaged over queries. TV,KL,JS from frozen metric implementation are secondary. Freeze all80 case predictions and selected masks before scoring any new outer target. Scoring command refuses incomplete freeze.",
  "claims_gate": "Geometry and grouping claims judged separately. No universal superiority or grouping benefit inferred from a composite pipeline. Failure versus coverage-matched shrinkage must be reported even when raw baseline improves. This protocol does not certify O1, feature-selection optimality, subject-disjoint generalization or model-byte savings.",
  "storage": "Private actual indices, costs/masks, raw arrays and individual predictions. Public code, protocols, aggregate metrics, source hashes. Cache-first verified data reuse; download only genuinely missing inputs under upstream terms.",
  "dependencies": "Bundled original E0 numerical model, E0.2 calibration and E0.3 coverage controls; no current manuscript text change. E0.3 nested parameter selection remains development-only and is not silently introduced into this fixed main protocol.",
